sqlite-vec (https://github.com/asg017/sqlite-vec)
Copyright (c) 2024 Alex Garcia
Loadable SQLite extension (vec0) — the official release binaries for
Windows x86_64, macOS aarch64/x86_64 and Linux x86_64/aarch64 are
downloaded by the build (version: sqlite-vec.version in pom.xml, SHA-256
pinned there) and packaged unmodified under native/sqlite-vec/ in the
jar, next to the license texts (LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE). They are
used only when app.vectorstore.type=sqlite-vec; a binary given via
SQLITE_VEC_EXTENSION_PATH takes precedence.
